; claude: JavaScript in a browser: what a page's scripts see and do,
; over the language (languages/javascript, which knows nothing of
; pages). Script_dom is the page's mutable copy; Script_host an
; element's host object, Script_element its members since the first
; DOM, Script_events an event of a script's own, Script_document
; document, Script_window window and its globals, Script_fetch and
; XMLHttpRequest a script asking the network; their types in
; Script_types; Browser_script the tasks (the scripts run, an event
; dispatched, the timers) and what the browser asks of them.
(library
 (name browser_dom)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules_without_implementation script_types) ; types alone
 (flags (:standard -open Network)) ; ours, not the Playground's (libs/network/dune)
 (libraries
   lang_html lang_css javascript
   browser_url
   network)) ; Urlencoded, a URL's query
